        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeri Ryan\n- Roles: Seven of Nine, Veronica \"Ronnie\" Cooke\n- TV Shows: Star Trek: Voyager, Body of Proof\n- Episodes: \"Missing\"\n\nFacts:\n- Jeri Ryan was born on February 22, 1968.\n- Jeri Ryan is best known for playing the Borg Seven of Nine on Star Trek: Voyager.\n- Jeri Ryan played Veronica \"Ronnie\" Cooke in the medical drama Body of Proof.\n- Body of Proof has a second-season episode titled \"Missing\".",
