        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4e33676b-5cb0-5d51-b5ac-1a5121aad65a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series and Episodes: Body of Proof, Body of Proof season 2, Missing\n- People: Christopher Murphey, Jeri Ryan, Jeri Lynn Zimmermann, Nicholas Bishop, John Carroll Lynch, Sonja Sohn, Geoffrey Arend, Windell Middlebrooks\n- Roles and Characters: Dr. Kate Murphy, Peter Dunlop, Bud Morris, Samantha Baker, Dr. Ethan Gross, Dr. Curtis Brumfield, Seven of Nine\n\nFacts:\n- Jeri Lynn Ryan, born Jeri Lynn Zimmermann on February 22, 1968, is a German actress.\n- Jeri Ryan is best known for playing the Borg character Seven of Nine and won a Saturn Award in 2001 after receiving four nominations for that role.\n- The second season of Body of Proof, an American television series created by Christopher Murphey, premiered in the United States on September 20, 2011.\n- Missing is the third episode of the second season of the American medical drama Body of Proof.\n- Body of Proof season 2 featured Nicholas Bishop as Peter Dunlop, Jeri Ryan as Dr. Kate Murphy, John Carroll Lynch as Bud Morris, Sonja Sohn as Samantha Baker, Geoffrey Arend as Dr. Ethan Gross, and Windell Middlebrooks as Dr. Curtis Brumfield.\n- The second season of Body of Proof concluded on April 10, 2012, and consisted of 20 episodes.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "5e40eb62-a89a-53ae-a01a-8ecd35cd6ec9",
        "text": "Page: Body of Proof (season 2). Sentence: The second season of \"Body of Proof\", an American television series created by Christopher Murphey, commenced airing in the United States on September 20, 2011, concluded April 10, 2012, and consisted of 20 episodes.\nPage: Body of Proof (season 2). Sentence: Along with Hunt solving homicide cases are her colleagues, Nicholas Bishop as Peter Dunlop, Jeri Ryan as Dr. Kate Murphy, John Carroll Lynch and Sonja Sohn as Detective's Bud Morris and Samantha Baker and fellow medical examiners, Geoffrey Arend as Dr. Ethan Gross and Windell Middlebrooks as Dr. Curtis Brumfield.\nPage: Jeri Ryan. Sentence: Jeri Lynn Ryan (born Jeri Lynn Zimmermann; February 22, 1968) is a German actress best known for her role as the Borg Seven of Nine on \"\", for which she was nominated four times for a Saturn Award and won in 2001.\nPage: Missing (Body of Proof). Sentence: \"Missing\" is the third episode of the second season of the American medical drama \"Body of Proof\".",
